Subject: [PATCH 183/260] [ae-patch] Keep the composer's prompt suggestion
 until the next prompt

Hold the latest session.suggestion in server memory (6 hours, 1000 sessions), replay it to a new stream subscriber, and drop it on a clear or when a turn starts. The web bind no longer wipes a replay that lands during the snapshot fetch.
